== History ==
2024
*The Goblin Giant's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 1/7/2024, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/7/2024)|July 2024 Update]] {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved Goblin Giant after death {{Balance|Add}}.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, the [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the [[Spear Goblins]]’ first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.3 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 30/1/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (30/1/2025)|maintenance break]], made it so that [[Rune Giant]]'s damage boost would no longer affect the Evolved Goblin Giant's [[Spear Goblins]] {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Goblin Giant's spawn speed to 1.8 seconds (from 1.5 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 31/3/2024, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Evolved Goblin Giant's hitpoints by 0.03% {{Balance|Buff}}. It also fixed a bug where Spear Goblins would not spawn after being buffed by [[Royal Chef]] {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Spear Goblins’ first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.4 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and decreased their range to 5 tiles (from 5.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 5/9/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/9/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Goblin Giant's spawn speed to 2.2 seconds (from 1.8 seconds).
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Backpack Spear Goblins' first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.4 seconds), and decreased his range to 5 tiles (from 5.5 tiles).
2026

* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Goblin Giant's Hitpoints by 3%

